    (property "Intersheetrefs" "${INTERSHEET_REFS}" (at 284.48 367.03 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
  )
  (text "CHARGER BQ25713 (NVDC)\n- VBUS_SYS -> RAC 10m -> buck-boost (Q1-Q4, L1) -> VSYS. BATFET Q5 (P-ch) VSYS <-> baterai.\n- Arus charge default = 0 A: baterai TIDAK diisi sampai MCU menulis ChargeCurrent via I2C (0x6B).\n- ILIM_HIZ membatasi arus input ~3A secara hardware.\n- CELL_BATPRESZ juga menentukan SYSOVP (1S=5V, 2S=12V, 3-4S=19.5V) -> harus SESUAI jumlah cell asli.\n\nSW1 CELL CONFIG (set saat baterai dilepas, dibaca saat boot):\n  Cell | pos1 pos2 pos3 pos4 | pos5 pos6 pos7\n  1S   |  ON  off  off  off  |  ON   ON   ON\n  2S   |  off  ON  off  off  |  ON   ON  off\n  3S   |  off off  ON   off  |  ON  off  off\n  4S   |  off off  off  ON   | off  off  off\n  pos1-4 HANYA satu yang ON. pos5-7 men-short pin VC BQ40Z50 yang tidak dipakai.\n  MCU mengecek: CELL_SENSE (ADC) vs register BQ25713 vs tegangan per-cell BQ40Z50. Tidak cocok -> FAULT." (at 404 22.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "ccfecccf-7aa7-5d03-916d-4013f36908e4")
  )
)
